  "description": "The new Melee is our first ground-up aero bicycle development using our Real-World Fast protocol.\n\nUL Black Melee v2 features an ultralight clear over raw carbon finish with minimal graphics, putting it 40g lighter than the White Lightning and other fully painted Melee v2 bikes.\n\nIn 2022, ENVE introduced its first production road bike – the Melee – a race bike that offered unprecedented versatility and established a foundation of performance. Melee v2 builds upon this foundation to deliver a truly world class, benchmark World Tour level race bike.\n\nAchieving under 6.8 kg complete bicycle is not an insignificant challenge in the era of disc brakes, batteries, and the never ending pursuit for more aerodynamic efficiency.\n\nA Melee v2 with UL Black paint, in size 56cm, can readily achieve a complete bike weight of 6.8 kg.\n\nENVE products deemed eligible for coverage under the ENVE Limited Lifetime Warranty will be replaced or repaired at the discretion of ENVE for the defined period from date of purchase for firsthand original owners, and from date of the original product’s manufacture for secondhand owners.",
